---
id: org.dxos.plugin.codeGraph
name: CodeGraphPlugin
version: 0.1.0
---

A canvas of the codebase, built from code-index. Boxes are resources in the index (packages, files,
symbols); arrows are facts between them (imports, package dependencies). The assistant fills and reshapes
a graph by querying the index. The canvas lays the same graph out with the illustrator's semantic engine,
a force-directed layout, or by dependency rank, and can show the illustrator's full drawing.

Dev only: the page reaches the index through a `vite dev` route that runs `code-index mcp` beside the app
(`tauri dev` loads the same dev server). See `docs/DESIGN.md`.

